<view class="page-shell home-page"><view class="home-head"><view><view class="eyebrow">星座卡牌 · DAILY</view><view class="title">先照顾此刻，再往前一步</view></view><picker mode="selector" range="{{signNames}}" value="{{selectedIndex}}" bindchange="chooseSign"><view class="sign-picker"><text class="sign-glyph">{{glyph}}</text><text>{{signChosen ? selectedSign : '选择星座'}}</text><text class="chevron">⌄</text></view></picker></view><view class="home-promise"><text>一张卡</text><text>·</text><text>一个小行动</text><text>·</text><text>一段可以靠近的关系</text></view><view class="first-note">{{heroNote}}</view><view class="card-wrap {{cardAnimating ? 'card-enter' : ''}}" bindtap="openDetail" role="button" aria-label="查看今日星座卡详情"><view class="card-context">TODAY / 今日星座卡</view><reading-card card="{{card}}" /></view><view class="actions"><button class="primary-button" style="width:100%" bindtap="openDraw"><text>抽一张今日主签</text><text class="button-arrow">→</text></button><button class="secondary-action" style="width:100%" bindtap="saveCard">{{isFavorite ? '已收藏 · 点击取消' : '收藏今日卡'}}</button><button class="secondary-action" style="width:100%" open-type="share">分享给朋友</button></view><view class="daily-action"><view class="section-index">01 / 把灵感变成行动</view><view class="action-copy">{{card.tip}}</view><action-followup card="{{card}}" compact="{{true}}" bind:statuschange="actionChanged"/><button class="action-link" bindtap="openDice">把这句话交给一件小事 <text>→</text></button></view><view class="journey-entry" bindtap="openJourney" role="button"><view class="journey-entry-symbol">✦</view><view class="journey-entry-main"><block wx:if="{{journey.completed}}"><view class="journey-entry-title">七日星光总结</view><view class="journey-entry-copy">七天完成，回头看看你留给自己的这一页</view></block><block wx:elif="{{journey.started}}"><view class="journey-entry-title">七日星光旅程</view><view class="journey-entry-copy">第 {{journey.currentDay}} / 7 天 · 今天只做一件小事</view></block><block wx:else><view class="journey-entry-title">七日星光旅程</view><view class="journey-entry-copy">用七天，给自己留一条线索</view></block></view><text class="journey-entry-arrow">↗︎</text></view><view wx:if="{{lastAction && lastAction.id !== card.id}}" class="return-action"><view class="section-index">LAST / 上次的小行动</view><view class="return-copy">{{lastAction.advice || lastAction.title}}</view><action-followup action="{{lastAction}}" compact="{{true}}" bind:statuschange="actionChanged"/></view><view class="ritual-entries"><button class="ritual-entry spread-entry" bindtap="openSpread"><view class="entry-kicker">01 / THE STAR ATLAS</view><view class="ritual-entry-name">三张星光 <text>↗︎</text></view><view class="ritual-entry-caption">心里留个问题，凭直觉选三张</view><view class="entry-fan"><view></view><view></view><view></view></view></button><button class="ritual-entry answer-entry" bindtap="openAnswer"><view class="entry-kicker">02 / A PAGE FOR YOU</view><view class="ritual-entry-name">答案之书 <text>↗︎</text></view><view class="ritual-entry-caption">选一个数字，收下一页温柔</view><view class="entry-book">✦</view></button></view><view class="connection-entries"><button bindtap="openPair"><text class="connection-mark">✧ ✧</text><view><view>双人星图</view><text>和某个人一起，找到一个靠近的角度</text></view><text>↗︎</text></button><button bindtap="openDice"><text class="connection-mark">✦</text><view><view>星光骰子</view><text>把星光落成一件今天能做的小事</text></view><text>↗︎</text></button></view><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">再给自己一个角度</view><text class="section-aside">牌阵 · 答案 · 自我探索</text></view><view class="explore-list"><button wx:for="{{themes}}" wx:key="id" class="entry-row" style="width:100%" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openTheme"><view class="entry-number">{{item.mark}}</view><view class="entry-content"><view class="entry-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="entry-caption">{{item.caption}}</view></view><text class="entry-arrow">↗︎</text></button></view><button class="quiz-entry" style="width:100%" bindtap="openQuiz"><view class="quiz-entry-top"><text>{{quizDraft ? '继续上次测试' : '趣味自我探索'}}</text><text>{{quizDraft ? '已答 ' + quizDraft.answers.length + '/8' : '8 道题 / 约 2 分钟'}}</text></view><view class="quiz-entry-name">你更喜欢哪种充电方式？<text>→</text></view></button><view class="daily-footnote">每日内容按主题轮换 · 仅供娱乐与自我探索</view></view>
